<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.1</TargetFrameworks>
    <Version>0.22.7</Version>
    <AssemblyName>Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace</RootNamespace>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == 'Release' ">true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild Condition="'$(Configuration)'=='TemplateRelease'">true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Description>Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace 修改命名空间</Description>
    <Copyright>NeuCharFramework</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>NeuCharFramework,NCF,Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace</PackageTags>
    <Authors>NeuCharFramework</Authors>
    <Owners>NeuCharFramework</Owners>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Title>XNCF 更改命名空间模块</Title>
    <ProjectUrl> https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NCF</ProjectUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NcfPackageSources</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>icon.jpg</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
      v0.1 创世
      v0.2 完成修改命名空间功能
      v0.3 完成还原命名空间功能
      v0.4 升级命名空间修改功能
      [2024-09-10] v0.19.4-preview1 升级缓存基础库
      [2025-01-25] v0.20.5-preview1 Update Agents functions, support for function calling
      [2025-04-29] v0.20.7-preview1 Update CO2NET and AIKernel
      [2025-05-18] v0.20.8-preview1 Update Installation
      [2025-06-20] v0.20.9-preview1 Add MCP functions in XncfRegisterBase class
      [2025-11-01] update basic libraries, including Senparc.AI
      [2026-04-24] Simplify FunctionRender request parameters and keep SelectionList UI metadata compatibility
      [2026-07-17] v0.22.0-preview2 为 ChangeNamespace 模块接入统一资源本地化并优化功能文案
      1、接入统一资源本地化机制，支持模块功能文案按当前文化动态显示
      2、更新 FunctionRender 与请求模型文案的资源化解析
      3、统一模块注册信息、菜单名称与功能描述的本地化输出
      4、补充并统一多语言资源键及资源文件
      [2026-07-29] v0.22.1-preview3 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.23.4-preview3
      [2026-07-31] v0.22.2-preview4 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.23.5-preview4
      [2026-08-04] v0.22.3-preview5 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.24.0-preview5
      [2026-08-08] v0.22.4-preview6 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.24.1-preview6
      [2026-08-13] v0.22.5-preview7 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.25.0-preview7
      [2026-08-15] v0.22.6-preview8 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.25.1-preview8
      [2026-08-22] v0.22.7-preview9 同步 Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace 依赖版本
      1、递归更新上游项目依赖，保持 Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace 与当前版本组合兼容
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NeuCharFramework/NcfPackageSources</RepositoryUrl>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;Test;TemplateRelease</Configurations>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == 'Release' ">
    <OutputPath>..\..\BuildOutPut</OutputPath>
    <DocumentationFile>..\..\BuildOutPut\Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace.XML</DocumentationFile>
    <DefineConstants>$(DefineConstants);RELEASE</DefineConstants>
    <Optimize>true</Optimize>
    <DebugType>pdbonly</DebugType>
    <ErrorReport>prompt</ErrorReport>
    <CodeAnalysisRuleSet>MinimumRecommendedRules.ruleset</CodeAnalysisRuleSet>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)'=='TemplateRelease'">
    <OutputPath>..\..\BuildOutPut</OutputPath>
    <DocumentationFile>..\..\BuildOutPut\Senparc.Xncf.ChangeNamespace.XML</DocumentationFile>
    <DefineConstants>$(DefineConstants);RELEASE</DefineConstants>
    <Optimize>true</Optimize>
    <DebugType>pdbonly</DebugType>
    <ErrorReport>prompt</ErrorReport>
    <CodeAnalysisRuleSet>MinimumRecommendedRules.ruleset</CodeAnalysisRuleSet>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\icon.jpg" Pack="true" Visible="false" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Basic\Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase\Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
